Authoritative reference for Mistral Vibe — the CLI agent you (the model) are running inside.

LOAD when the user:
- asks anything about Vibe itself, even by indirect name ("this CLI", "this tool", "you");
- wants to change, inspect, or reset their setup;
- asks why the agent did or did not act;
- asks how to make the CLI do X, where X lives, or what a flag/command/setting…
